1. Source code for network users (AGPL-3.0, section 13)

If you run a modified version of Starry API and let other people interact with
it through a computer network, section 13 requires you to offer those users the
corresponding source code of your modified version. The console shows a
"Source code" link in its footer for this purpose. Its address is the runtime
setting STARRY_SOURCE_URL (default https://github.com/StaR4y/starry-api). If
you modify the code, point STARRY_SOURCE_URL at where your modified source can
be downloaded. See docs/CONFIGURATION.md.


